}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"White decedents were the referent group because they represented the largest racial/ethnic group.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"States were anonymously classified by PRMR and grouped into lowest, middle, and highest tertiles by PRMR\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Dashes indicate fewer than 10 deaths; these results were suppressed because ratios might be unreliable.\"}], \"confidence\": \"high\", \"uncertain_fields\": []}", "type": "text"}]}